# L038 requests. The ports are chosen by the operating system at start-up
# (port 0), so there is no fixed address. When the program is running, put
# the gateway's address here if you want to call it from your editor; the
# lesson's own run does not need this file.
@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:5000

### The catalog, through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/catalog/products/7

### Stock, through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/stock/levels/7
